
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    
    box Notarisation sequence analysis
    actor vnode as V Node operator
    participant Member1 as Member Cluster  
    participant notary as Notary Cluster
    participant Member2 as Peer Member Cluster
    
    end
    
   vnode->>Member1: Execute Flow <br/>RPC/api/v1/flow/$HOLDING_ID:"startFlow":{"clientRequestId":"r1", <br/> "flowClassName":"net.cordapp.testing.calculator.CalculatorFlow",<br/>"requestData":"{\"a\":10,\"b\":20}"}
   

   Note over vnode,Member1: DF_FLOW_REQ
    rect rgb(200, 150, 255)
    note right of Member1: Spoofing, Repudiation, Dos, Elev of Priv.
    end 
   Member1-->>vnode: return status: START_REQUIRED
   vnode-->>Member1: Check Status <br/>RPC/api/v1/flow/$HOLDING_ID:r1
   Note over vnode,Member1: DF_FLOW_STAT1
    rect rgb(200, 150, 255)
    note right of Member1: Spoofing, Tampering, Repudiation, Dos, Elev of Priv.
    end 
   Member1->>+vnode: return status: RUNNING

   Member1->>+Member1: Flow code: <br/>UtxoLedgerService.finalize (participant peer ID)
   Note over Member1: DF_SANDBOX_FINALIZE1

   alt
    Member1->>+Member2: P2P sessions ResponserFlow.call via P2P
    Note over Member1, Member2: DF_P2P_RESPONDER_FLOW
    rect rgb(200, 150, 255)
    note right of Member2: Spoofing, Tampering, <br/>Repudiation, Info Disc,<br/> Dos, Elev of Priv.
    end 
    Member2->>+Member2: LedgerService.<br/>receiveFinality(session,validationMethod) 
    Member2-->>Member1: return Tx signed by Peer
   else sendUnseenSignaturesToCounterparties
    Note over Member1: DF_sendUnseenSignaturesToCounterParties 
    rect rgb(200, 150, 255)
    note right of Member2: Repudiation
    end 

   end
   alt Non validation Notarization
    Member1->>+notary: Non validating Tx Notarization(TxId, input state references, <br/> State references, number of outputs, time window, notary, Merkle proofs )
    Note over Member1,notary: DF_NV_NOTARIZATION_REQ 
    rect rgb(200, 150, 255)
    note right of notary: Denial of State.
    end 

    notary->>+notary: Notary checks(OK)
    notary->>+notary: UXTO Ledger Update
    notary-->>Member1: return notary signature
    Note over Member1,notary: DF_NV_NOTARIZATION_RES 

   else validating Notarisation (custom implementation)
    Member1->>+notary: Validating Tx Notarization(Whole Tx, states...)
    Note over Member1,notary: DF_VAL_NOTARIZATION_REQ 
    rect rgb(200, 150, 255)
    note right of notary: Info Disclosure, denial of service
    end 
    notary->>+notary: Notary checks(OK)
    notary->>+notary: UXTO Ledger Update
    Note over Member1,notary: DF_VAL_NOTARIZATION_RES 
    notary-->>Member1: return notary signature
    

   end
   Member1->>+Member2: send Notary Signatures To Counterparties
    rect rgb(200, 150, 255)
      
    note right of Member2: Denial of Service/State2,<br/> Repudiation(both sides)
    end 

   Member2-->>Member1: return
